X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Livemusicasheville": "https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/soul-nite-with-the-monterio-experience/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:livemusicasheville
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260417T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260418T010000
DTSTAMP:20260417T230455
CREATED:20260406T175937Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260406T180206Z
UID:10054832-1776463200-1776474000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Soul Nite with The Monterio Experience
DESCRIPTION:The Monterio Experience: A Soundtrack for Every Soul \n\nIn a city known for its vibrant culture and close-knit music community\, one band continues to rise above the rest with its electrifying performances and genre-defying setlists: The Monterio Experience. This dynamic cover band has carved out a reputation as the ultimate live act in eastern North Carolina\, bringing a level of passion\, polish\, and versatility that few can match.\n\n\n\nAt the heart of the band’s success is frontman Eric Monterio\, whose commanding stage presence and astonishing vocal range have earned him a loyal following. Monterio isn’t just a singer—he’s a vocal chameleon\, effortlessly shifting from silky R&B tones to gritty rock growls\, from soulful ballads to upbeat pop anthems. His ability to interpret a song\, inject emotion\, and make it his own is the cornerstone of the band’s appeal.\n\n\n\nWhether it’s a classic Stevie Wonder tune\, a high-energy Bruno Mars hit\, or a country favorite from Chris Stapleton\, The Monterio Experience delivers every performance with authenticity and flair.\n\n\n\n10pm | $10 \nThe Double Crown – Great vibes\, great bourbon\, and great music! (21+ only\, dog friendly) A West Asheville institution\, the Double Crown hosts Western Wednesdays\, karaoke\, DJ’s and rousing Gospel & Soul night’s each month. It’s a great place for an intimate evening of dancing\, drinks and fun\, especially if you love a good dive bar.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/soul-nite-with-the-monterio-experience/
LOCATION:The Double Crown West Asheville\, 375 West Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_0314-scaled-e1775498357453.jpeg
GEO:35.5780389;-82.5787972
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Double Crown West Asheville 375 West Haywood Rd Asheville NC 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=375 West Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5787972,35.5780389
END:VEVENT
