UID:10035765-1776506400-1776528000@www.riverartsdistrict.com
SUMMARY:Go With the Flow: Adventures in Fluid Acrylics with Robyn Crawford\, APR 18th (10am to 4pm) 2026
DESCRIPTION:$165.00\nSaturday\, April 18th – 10 AM to 4 PM- $165 – All materials supplied! \nIf you’ve ever watched those hypnotic fluid‑acrylic videos and thought\, I want to feel that magic\, this workshop is your chance to dive in—literally and creatively. Expect to feel mesmerized\, loosened up\, and totally absorbed as you watch color swirl\, stretch\, and dance across your canvas. This is the kind of class where you lose track of time in the best possible way. \nYou’ll experience the joy of letting paint move with you instead of fighting against you\, discovering how different mediums\, consistencies\, and techniques create wildly different effects. Instead of frustration or muddy results\, you’ll feel that satisfying “ohhh\, that’s how it works” click as everything starts to flow. With plenty of demos\, hands‑on experimenting\, and space to play\, you’ll leave with pieces that feel alive—and uniquely yours. \nIt’s a relaxed\, creative\, slightly addictive kind of day\, complete with a lunch break to recharge and admire your works‑in‑progress. All materials are included; all you need to bring is your curiosity (and a snack). \nThis class seats 8 students. For any questions regarding our cancellation or transfer policy\, please refer to the link in our navigation bar. \nRobyn Crawford studied at Emerson College\, Massachusetts College of Art\, and Rochester Institute of Technology’s School of Photographic Arts and Sciences. She has been a mixed media artist\, photographer\, teacher\, and creativity coach for over 30 years and has exhibited work throughout the Carolinas.
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/go-with-the-flow-adventures-in-fluid-acrylics-with-robyn-crawford-apr-18th-10am-to-4pm-2026/
LOCATION:310 ART at Re Imagine Studio\, 15 Spivey Lake Drive\, Fairview\, NC\, 28730\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes
