SUMMARY:Mindful Meet & Mingle at Quietude 
DESCRIPTION:Mindful Meet & Mingle – Asheville Singles\n**Mindful Meet & 
 Mingle at Quitetude**\nAn easygoing evening of connection and community. A
  relaxed evening for mindful singles to connect with like-hearted people i
 n a warm\, easy atmosphere. This is a community member hosted event.\n\nTh
 is is a connection event (not a dating specific event) for singles. We'll 
 open with some grounding and centering time at the beautiful Lodge at Quie
 tude. Then we'll split up into pairs with suggested questions with the int
 ention to develop meaningful connections. You'll have the opportunity to p
 air up four or five times with a brief centering before each new encounter
 . Then we'll have an open time to socialize.\n\nWhether you’re new to As
 heville\, exploring dating with more awareness\, or simply wanting to meet
  conscious\, grounded people\, you’re welcome here.\n\nA few notes:\nSpa
 ce is limited and capped at 30 people\nOpen to all mindful singles
