X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Amcdance": "https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/313960044/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_amcdance
X-SOURCE:Asheville Movement Collective
UID:event_313960044@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260418T030447Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260419T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260419T123000
SUMMARY:'Collective Consciousness' AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Mart
 a Martin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, April 19th\n1st Dance 
 Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wa
 ve 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ \\| Faci
 litator Marta Martin\n\nIntention: Collective Consciousness\nHave we ever 
 thought of a friend and they called? Noticed something for the first time 
 and then it appeared everywhere? Are there coincidences? We are connected 
 to the collective consciousness in many ways. Which line of connection wil
 l we choose? Being called to the collective consciousness of our dance flo
 or\, may we choose love\, forgiveness and consent.\n\nAbout Facilitator Ma
 rta Martin\nMarta (she/her/ella) has been part of AMC since she moved to A
 sheville from Surfside\, FL in 2008. She has been teaching movement for ov
 er 30 years\, using music and movements from around the world.\nShe loves 
 to motivate people to find freedom in their bodies so they can dance to th
 e spirit. Listen to her mixes on Mixcloud ([https://www.mixcloud.com/Danci
 ngMarta/](https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAA
 YnJpZBExYTNseDVSbWlEYk5DQllsRnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR7by-
 wPjazR7tKhGGDYqagR4jn32qu7GWq2ivOQECzoLrTvNPNQsF2NfdIGZg_aem_Bo_oleQ4hGQ5q
 WQi-LqFnw) ) and Soundcloud ([https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta](https:/
 /soundcloud.com/dancingmarta?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExYTNseDVSbWlE
 Yk5DQllsRnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR7iFgls4gn3fqV5KpTOe8PWYD
 Z06xXSN8_tkahDsABjJQtDHcUoEwAIjFtnEg_aem_JP2YqJsE8vBPol8mPwWPTw) )\n\n\\~\
 \~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors cl
 ose promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive late will be turned a
 way. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nLo
 cation: Evergreen Community Charter School\, 50 Bell Road\, Asheville NC\,
  28805\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for
  lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Vol
 unteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevillemov
 ementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/vo
 lunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBw
 X2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTA
 tGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n
 Door will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO EN
 TRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://a
 shevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFU
 HNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69
 W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsh
 eville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where a
 ll are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mi
 ssion and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through fr
 ee-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transforma
 tion. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on the dance f
 loor!
