DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260419T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260419T120000
SUMMARY:Body Process Class: Restoration of Communion with Earth
DESCRIPTION:Access Consciousness® Asheville\n## What If Your Body Has Bee
 n Waiting for This?\n\n## **You’re Invited: Access Consciousness Body Pr
 ocess Class**\n\nWhat if your body isn’t something to fix…\nbut someth
 ing to listen to?\n\nWhat if it has been whispering (or maybe shouting) fo
 r your attention in ways you were never taught to understand?\n\nI’d lov
 e to invite you to a beautiful\, hands-on **Access Consciousness Body Proc
 ess class** — a space where you get to receive\, gift\, and explore a di
 fferent communion with bodies.\n\n### What Is a Body Process?\n\nAccess Co
 nsciousness Body Processes are gentle\, hands-on techniques that invite th
 e body to:\n• Release stored trauma and shock\n• Activate natural capa
 cities\n• Undo limitations held in tissue and cellular memory\n• Resto
 re communication between you and your body\n\nThis isn’t massage.\nIt is
 n’t energy work in the traditional sense.\nIt’s a conversation — wit
 h the body.\nAnd bodies respond.\n\n### In This Class You Will:\n\n✨ Lea
 rn a specific Access Body Process you can use for life\n✨ Both gift and 
 receive the process (yes\, you get sessions too!)\n✨ Explore how judgmen
 t impacts the body\n✨ Discover new tools for ease\, vitality\, and aware
 ness\n✨ Leave certified to practice this body process on others\n\nNo pr
 ior experience is required. Just a body. And a willingness.\n\n### What Be
 comes Possible?\n\nMany people report:\n• Increased ease in chronic patt
 erns\n• Greater relaxation and presence\n• Changes in long-held physic
 al limitations\n• A deeper sense of trust with their body\n\nBut more th
 an anything — possibility.\nWhat if your body has capacities you’ve ne
 ver been shown how to access?\n\nSpots are limited only by space - the soo
 ner you sign up the sooner we can look for larger locations if required.\n
 \nIf you’ve been asking for more ease\, more connection\, more *alivenes
 s* — this may be the invitation your body has been waiting for.\n\nWould
  your body enjoy this?\n\nA body process class is a way to experience a ne
 w energy. Each is uniquely different and contributes to the being. There a
 re NO contraindications - if it pulls you in it's right for you that day.\
 n\nThis class will include the body process **Restoration of Communion wit
 h Earth**!\n\nRegistration: https://www.consciousbeing.institute/event-det
 ails/body-process-class-restoration-of-communion-with-earth
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/access-consciousness-asheville/events
 /313581265/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260301T023316Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260301T023316Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
