SUMMARY:Pack Square Seed/Plant Share: Extra Spring Plants  🌱
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Garden Club Meetup Group\n**Where:** **Pack Square P
 ark – Reuters Terrace steps (Spruce St side)**\nFree street parking down
 town on Sundays • Pack Square & Rankin garages nearby\n\n***\n\n**Dont t
 hrow out those unplanted seeds and seedlings! If they were viable or past 
 due but viable bring them to Pack Square and share!**\nIf you havent notic
 ed\, seed prices have gone UP! If you need seeds or just want to try garde
 ning this is the low cost event for you!\n\n***\n\n### Bring\n\n* labelled
  seed packets\n* Healthy seedlings\, cuttings\, or divisions\n* A box or t
 ote for your haul\n\n***\n\n###\n\nSee you—along with your seeds\, start
 s\, and spring hopes—at **Pack Square on April 12\, 1–3 PM!**
