X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Asheville Mountains To Sea Trail Hiking Club": "https://www.meetup.com/asheville-mountains-to-sea-trail-hiking-club/events/314103935/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_asheville_mountains_to_sea_trail_hiking_club
X-SOURCE:Asheville Mountains-to-Sea Trail Hiking Club
UID:event_314103935@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260418T030446Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260420T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260420T110000
SUMMARY:Fresh Market toward visitor's Center
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Mountains-to-Sea Trail Hiking Club 2.0\nWe will meet
  near the Fresh Market on Highway 25 and walk 2.5 miles in on the MTS trai
 l and then back to the Fresh Market. This trail comes out on the road at l
 east twice\, so keep this in mind with dogs on the trail.\n\nThis is a fai
 rlly easy hike\, and we go at a high average to low advanced speed\, which
  is roughly about 3.0 to 3.2 mph. There are no super long hills. It's pret
 ty undulating all the way. The biggest hill is at the beginning.\n\nWell b
 ehaved dogs on leashes are welcome to attend.\n\nWhen you arrive\, park cl
 osest to the forest on the side where Haywood Appliance is.\n\nMountains-t
 o-Sea-Trail hikes are designed for fitness and community among people who 
 are already reasonably fit. It's not an endurance hike by any means\, but 
 it is designed so we can get our hearts beating a bit while still being ab
 le to have a conversation and meet new people.\nWhen you arrive\, we'll ci
 rcle up and introduce ourselves briefly. There will be a person who is a s
 weep. This person is the person who walks last and makes sure no one gets 
 lost.\n\nWe leave the parking spot at 9:10. If someone needs a nature brea
 k\, we wait fo you\, but it's not a hike where we stop and take photos or 
 frequent breaks. We basically keep hiking until the 1/2 way mark\, then tu
 rn around after a short (approximately 5 minute) break. Then we keep that 
 same pace on the way back. If we get on a trail right at 9:10\, we are nor
 mally finished around 10:50.\n\nThese are out and back hikes\, meaning tha
 t we hike in and turn around half way to return back.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-mountains-to-sea-trail-hiki
 ng-club/events/314103935/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260403T105742Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260403T105742Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
