SUMMARY:Explorer Loop - MST - South Ridge Loop - 6.6 Miles 1300+ Ft
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Details**\n\n* 6.6 Miles\, 1300 
 Ft elevation gain with option to add 300 more ft\n* Carpool meeting time i
 s 9:15 at the Asheville Outlets parking lot behind the Waffle House.\n* Si
 gn up starts Friday at 5pm\n\nThis is a nice Bent Creek loop starting at t
 he Explorer Loop trailhead and going up to the MST by Chestnut Cove. We wi
 ll head down the MST beyond Sleepy Gap and drop back into Bent Creek on a 
 no-name trail and back along South Ridge and Explorer Loop to the trailhea
 d. There is an option just after Chestnut Cove to go up to Grassy Knob and
  gain about another 300 ft of elevation. We will do a moderate pace of abo
 ut 2.7 mph but stop for breaks as needed.\n\nIt looks like the cooler weat
 her is returning next week but I am going to do a bit of an easier one on 
 Monday. I am substitute leading the fitness group hike on Wednesday so tha
 t will be my harder hike for the week.\n\n**CARPOOL**\nWe will meet at the
  Asheville Outlets behind the Waffle House at 9:15. Please be there a litt
 le early so we can leave at 9:15 for the trailhead. Parking is limited at 
 the Explorer Loop trailhead so please try to carpool.\n\n**WEATHER**\nI'll
  watch the weather and post a cancellation message by 7:30 AM if the forec
 ast is >50% chance of precipitation.\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\nYou can message me
  through MeetUp until 9:00 AM the day of. Cell reception may be sketchy\, 
 but you can try to text or call me up to the start of the hike: (508) 965-
 2333.\n\n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Group event involves hiking a
 nd\, possibly\, transportation to and from the meetup site. Participants a
 re responsible for their own safety and affirm that they have the appropri
 ate skills\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and supplies. Hiking may 
 involve risks to oneself and property. Neither your hike organizer nor Ash
 eville Hiking Group can assure your safety nor eliminate all risks. Partic
 ipants assume full responsibility for any injuries\, damages\, or losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314319897
 /
