SUMMARY:Sunset Yoga in the Park
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Adventures 30’s & 40’s\nJoin me for an incredibl
 e sunset yoga experience hosted by West Asheville Yoga.\n\nHere is what th
 ey have to say:\nMay we align our breath to sync with the beating of our h
 earts\, healing ourselves and this planet from the inside out. Wandering t
 hrough this life we connect with the elements. Through the earth\, our bre
 ath\, and Yoga we ground deep in our roots. The air is wild\, free and ful
 l of possibility. Water nourishes our souls while reminding us to go with 
 the flow. We ignite the fire of passion and light an awakening within\, be
 coming one with the elements and connecting under one sun.\nCo-taught by T
 ara Eschroender and Beth Erngren of West Asheville Yoga.\n\n\\*This class 
 takes place at Montford Park in the grassy area tucked into the embankment
 s behind the basketball courts.\n\nI will get there around 5:45 pm to flag
  people over if needed\, so make sure to use the message app! Class begins
  promptly at 6\, at which point my phone will be away for the rest of the 
 class\, so please make sure to get there with enough time to set up your m
 at and say hi :-)\n\nHere are a few essentials to bring along:\n\\*Water\n
 \\*Yoga Mat (if you don't have a yoga mat\, please message me\, and I can 
 bring an extra for you)\n\\*Extra layer(s) for Savasana\n\\*\\*\\*I would 
 also recommend bringing a blanket or towel that you don't mind getting dir
 ty to go under your yoga mat if you don't want to get dirt on your mat.\n\
 nThis class is $22\, and you must book your spot in advance. I have includ
 ed the link below. Please let me know if you have any questions :-) Thanks
 \, and look forward to seeing you there! This is my absolute favorite yoga
  class in Asheville!\n\nhttps://momence.com/West-Asheville-Yoga/Sunset-Yog
 a-in-Montford-Park/133619806?skipPreview=true
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-adventures-30-s-40-s/events
 /314155771/
