BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Riverartsdistrict": "https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/ukrainian-pysanky-easter-egg-workshop-10/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:riverartsdistrict
X-SOURCE:River Arts District
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T180000
DTSTAMP:20260417T230457
CREATED:20260312T004945Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260407T171330Z
UID:10035738-1776783600-1776794400@www.riverartsdistrict.com
SUMMARY:Ukrainian Pysanky Easter egg workshop
DESCRIPTION:Pysanky are a lot like Asheville- unique\, fun and colorful!\n\n\n\nIn this workshop we will be making beautiful Ukrainian Easter eggs – pysanky. You will learn the method of batik – also called wax-resist – dying. You will also be familiarized with the wide range of Ukrainian folk art traditional patterns\, designs and symbols and their history. The designs are made with beeswax which is melted in the flame of a candle and applied to the egg using a tool called a kistka. The eggs are dipped into successively darker dyes. At the end of the process the beeswax is melted off to reveal the beautiful and colorful design. You may use the traditional patterns\, or also freestyle and make up your own design. Pysanky are fun\, relaxing\, and meditative to create. And\, the symbols are all good wishes\, so it is always the perfect time to create eggs with symbols wishing for good health\, long life\, strength and protection and other good things. \n\n\n\n$75 per person (cash/check) or $78 (credit card) includes use of all supplies. Please contact me for more information or to sign up! $10 discount for WNC residents – mention code: WNC2026. \nFull schedule at https://www.ashevillestudioa.com/workshops or contact me to if you’d like to request a different date! \nEmail andreakulish [at] gmail dot com or call/text 828 423 6459 to sign up or for more info!
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/ukrainian-pysanky-easter-egg-workshop-10/
LOCATION:Studio A
CATEGORIES:Classes,Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/PysankyEggs_MissionHosp_AndreaKulish_png8.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Andrea Kulish":MAILTO:andreakulish@gmail.com
GEO:35.5822159;-82.5643832
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Unca": "https://go.unca.edu/event/super-mega-music-festival/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:unca
X-SOURCE:UNC Asheville
DTSTART;TZID=America/Halifax:20260421T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Halifax:20260421T210000
