BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Shutupandwriteasheville": "https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/313195019/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_shutupandwriteasheville
X-SOURCE:Shut Up & Write Western NC
UID:event_313195019@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260418T030458Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T193000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® - Downtown
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Western North Carolina\nShut Up & Write!\n\
 n**Here's how it works.** Show up at or before 6:00. At 6:00\, we do some 
 quick introductions. Afterward\, for a full 60 minutes (I'll set a timer!)
  we are heads-down writing. Writing what? A novel? You bet. Some poetry? S
 ure. Song lyrics? Your resume? That report you need to get to your boss be
 fore 8 AM or you'll *need* *to write* that resume? All of the above and mo
 re. Just shut up and write.\n\nSurrounding ourselves with other writers wh
 o are busy putting words onto page (physical or virtual) keeps us all acco
 untable and focused.\n\nWhen the timer goes off\, we'll check-in with each
  other and see how it went. Afterward\, feel free to stay to chat and get 
 to know your fellow writers\, or keep writing\, or take off.\n\nSocializin
 g is optional and will happen after (or briefly before) the focused writin
 g. This is a safe space to work on your craft. No one will read or critiqu
 e your writing.\n\nFor more information about our events\, visit [https://
 shutupwrite.com](https://shutupwrite.com).\n\n**What to Expect**\n\n* Roug
 hly 15 minutes of introductions\n* 60 minutes of focused writing (somebody
  set a timer)!\n* Afterward\, optional socializing\n\n**Being late is okay
 :** Just show up and get settled\, then check in with the host after the s
 ession. (Look for the person with the Shut Up & Write sign).\n\n**What Sho
 uld I Bring?**\n\n* Whatever you need to be able to write!\n* Earbuds/earp
 lugs if you want to block ambient noise.\n\n**Other Important Details:**\n
 \nHOSTS: This is a multi-host event\, so most of the time there will be a 
 host present. If we are unlucky and no host can attend\, please find each 
 other and self-organize. Pay attention to the event chat and comments to s
 ee who is available.\n\nWI-FI: Yes!\n\nPARKING: Street parking in metered 
 spots is free after 6pm. Closest municipal garages ($2/hour) are Wall St. 
 & Coxe Street/Sears Alley.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwriteasheville/events/313195
 019/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260203T221145Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260203T221145Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
