 re Ave\, R Meadow Rd\, R huntsman place.\n\n5.10 Mile Hi-Wire Big TopL Mea
 dow Rd\, L Biltmore (aer you cross)\,R Unadilla Ave\, Stay L on Unadill
 a AveL Castle Street\, L Forest Hill DrR Wyoming Rd\, Straight Lakewood Dr
 \, R Lakewood Dr\, Stay on Lakewood Dr\,R Plymouth Cir\, R Duke St\, R Ken
