DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T120000
SUMMARY:Saturday Morning 5 KM or 10 KM Walk in Morganton City
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nWalk Morganton City with 
 a choice of 5 KM/3.1 mile and 10 KM/6.2 mile guided walks. The walks inclu
 de interesting neighborhoods and the picturesque downtown/stately courthou
 se area. It also includes a quaint little park. The 10 KM adds the site wh
 ere the only woman in NC history was hanged (bet you have heard of the son
 g featuring this event).\n\nWe will be walking with the Asheville Amblers\
 , AARP\, Stryder\, and perhaps more. The walk is free\, but the Amblers ac
 cept donations ($4 suggested).\n\nRegister in the parking lot at 201 N Gre
 en Street at 8:30 a.m. with step-off at 9:00. I suspect a large group will
  include a Dutch treat lunch at Boulevard BBQ after the walk\; you are wel
 come to join in if you are interested in doing so.\n\nThese walks include 
 some moderate hills and stair climbing but are almost entirely on pavement
 . They are suitable for strollers\, but not for wheelchairs. Sorry\, only 
 service dogs this time.\n\nRestrooms are scarce\, so be prepared.\n\nDress
  for the weather. Bring water and a protein snack. Some might want walking
  sticks due to the hills. Tennis shoes will be fine.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/314340827/
