SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260418T030455Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T170000
SUMMARY:Interest List: Mindful Speed Dating Event 55+
DESCRIPTION:Mindful Meet & Mingle – Asheville Singles\n**This is an appl
 ication-based event.**\n**RSVP on Meetup does not mean that you have regis
 ter for this event.**\n\nParticipation requires completing a short interes
 t form and receiving a private registration link. This is paid event. Plea
 se do not make travel plans or assume attendance until you receive a confi
 rmation email.\n\nhttps://forms.gle/UiMjc9CwpPr9Wipa9\n\nAbout Event\nMeet
  in the Moment is a guided\, speed-dating style experience for conscious s
 ingles who want to slow down\, drop out of small talk\, and connect with p
 resence and authenticity.\nThis is not traditional speed dating. There is 
 no pressure to perform\, impress\, or decide anything in the moment. Inste
 ad\, you’ll be gently guided into embodied connection through simple min
 dfulness prompts\, structured one-on-one conversations\, and moments of re
 flection.\nThe intention is to help you feel grounded\, relaxed\, and real
  while meeting others who value emotional availability\, curiosity\, and m
 eaningful connection.\n\nWhat to Expect\n\n* A short opening grounding pra
 ctice to help you arrive and settle\n* A series of timed\, one-on-one conv
 ersations with gentle prompts\n* Clear structure so you can relax and be y
 ourself\n* Space to reflect and notice how connection feels in your body\n
 * A warm\, inclusive\, and respectful environment\n\nYou do not need datin
 g experience\, meditation experience\, or confidence in small talk. Just c
 ome as you are.\n\nWho is this for\n\n* Singles who want deeper connection
 \, not surface-level chatting\n* People who value mindfulness\, emotional 
 awareness\, and authenticity\n* Those curious about meeting others in a sl
 ower\, more intentional way\n* Anyone feeling tired of dating apps or conv
 entional speed dating\n\nImportant Notes\n\n* This event is designed for p
 eople who are emotionally available and open to respectful connection\n* Y
 ou will never be asked to share anything you’re uncomfortable sharing\n*
  Attraction is welcome\, but there is no expectation to match or follow up
 \n\nTicketing & Balance\n\nTo support a balanced experience\, tickets are 
 offered by gender and capped to keep numbers even. If one ticket type sell
 s out\, you may join the waitlist.\n\nWe run the event **every other month
 ** with alternating age ranges: 35–54 and 55–74. Choose the session th
 at aligns with your life stage.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/mindful-meet-mingle-asheville-singles
 /events/313817366/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260317T135927Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260317T135927Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
