SUMMARY:CLASS MOB 2: Biltmore McDonalds & French Broad River Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nWhat is a CLASS MOB? It's when a
  group of people show up way overdressed at somewhere like a McDonalds or 
 a dive bar.\n\nWe suggest dressing like you are going to a wedding but are
 n't a part of the wedding party. We encourage you to go beyond business ca
 sual and get dressed up. Check out the photo if you're looking for inspira
 tion.\n\nWe'll be going to the classy Biltmore McDonalds (the McDonalds wi
 th a self-playing piano) and then a nearby brewery.\n\nHere's our schedule
 :\n\n6pm - 7pm: Biltmore McDonalds\n7pm - 9pm: French Broad River Brewery\
 n9:30pm - 11:30pm - DJ Aziz Vora @ Double Crown - RSVP [here](https://www.
 meetup.com/20s-30s-40s-friendly-people-do-cool-stuff/events/314172268/?eve
 ntOrigin=home_next_event_you_are_hosting)\n\nHope to see you there!
