  Facilitator Kristikka\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ\nDJ Kristikka\, Kri
 s Hostikka loves creating a sacred container that takes you on an inward j
 ourney utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment to chaos and down
  into stillness and integration. She feels that movement is medicine\, wea
 ving intention and a rich blend of world beats where it’s possible to be
  with what is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt and moved. You can 
 find her dance mixes here: [http://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka](https://so
 undcloud.com/dj-kristikka?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e0_tv4&fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0C
