 m up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late wi
 ll be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container
 . \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned aw
 ay for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://asheville
 movementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=ht
