DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 3rd\n\n1st Dance W
 ave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wav
 e 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ Esmae \\(
