SUMMARY:On International Sun Day\, Let's Walk at Lake Junaluska
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nMay 3 may be Internationa
 l Sun Day\, but this walk will proceed rain or shine (unless there is ligh
 tening). Let's hope for a sunny Sunday.\n\nGather at 2:00 at Lake Junalusk
 a inside the Bethea Welcome Center. This will be a 7 KM/4 mile route. The 
 walk does not just go around the lake\, but up to Lambuth Inn\, along the 
 Rose Walk\, and through the Nature Garden. The view from Inspiration Point
  is a must-see!\n\nDress for the weather. Consider a hat and sunscreen. So
 me people may want walking poles\, especially for the walk up to Lambuth I
 nn\; tennis shoes should be fine. It is particularly important that walker
 s bring a protein snack and **plenty of** **water**. Restrooms are availab
 le at the Welcome Center\, at Lambuth Inn\, and along the route. Dogs on l
 eash are welcome. Strollers are ok.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/313807680/
