X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_312929983@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260418T030449Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260505T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260505T193000
SUMMARY:AVL Digital Nomads - Book Club!
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**May Selection - *Beautiful Country: A Me
 moir of an Undocumented Childhood* by Qian Julie Wang**\n\nIn Chinese\, th
 e word for America\, Mei Guo\, translates directly to “beautiful country
 .” Yet when seven-year-old Qian arrives in New York City in 1994 full of
  curiosity\, she is overwhelmed by crushing fear and scarcity. In China\, 
 Qian’s parents were professors\; in America\, her family is “illegal
 ” and it will require all the determination and small joys they can must
 er to survive. Inhabiting her childhood perspective with exquisite lyric c
 larity and unforgettable charm and strength\, Qian Julie Wang has penned a
 n essential American story about a family fracturing under the weight of i
 nvisibility\, and a girl coming of age in the shadows\, who never stops se
 eking the light.\n\n**Welcome** to our robust and engaging Book Club! We'r
 e a small\, friendly group dedicated to fostering lively discussions about
  our monthly book selections. Whether you've read the entire book\, just a
  few chapters\, or even if you're simply curious about the title\, we'd lo
 ve to have you join us!\n\n**Meeting Schedule**: We gather on the First Tu
 esday of every month for our book discussions.\n\nWhat sets us apart is ou
 r small group size and directed discussions. This intimate setting allows 
 for deeper\, more engaging conversations where everyone's voice can be hea
 rd. It's the perfect environment for those who love to dive deep into them
 es\, characters\, and the intricacies of storytelling.\n\nSo whether you'r
 e a seasoned bookworm or just dipping your toes into the world of literatu
 re\, we invite you to join us. Let's explore new worlds\, challenge our pe
 rspectives\, and forge new friendships - one book at a time!\n\n**June Pic
 k: *Is A River Alive: A Journey with Water* by Robert MacFarlane**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/312929983/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260117T164345Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260117T164345Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
