 USIC w/ Servants of Music \\| Facilitator Kris Hostikka\nIntention: TBA\n\
 n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doo
 rs close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned 
 away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTic
 ket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack o
 f funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcolle
 ctive.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../dj
 seigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYX
