SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ SeigeA
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 10th\n\n1st Dance 
 Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wa
 ve 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ \\| Faci
 litator SeigeA\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the
  dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and p
 eople who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a s
 afe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your pric
 e.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration
  Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER
 !\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer
  at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevill
 emovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aE
 xURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCIt
 A4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\n
 IMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening 
 circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollecti
 ve agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJ
 pZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB72
 38bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQ
 YKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world tha
 t moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within 
 a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and he
 althy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for persona
 l and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.
 \n\nSee you on the dance floor!
