X-SOURCE:Haywood County Walking Group
UID:event_313816490@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260418T030453Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260510T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260510T160000
SUMMARY:Mother's Day Walk in Waynesville from Mast General to Middle Schoo
 l & Back
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nBring your mother\, or an
 yone else\, or come alone. Let's do a Mother's Day walk in Waynesville.\n\
 nMeet at 2:00 in front of Mast General Store\, 63 N. Main St.\, Waynesvill
 e NC 28786. We will meet at the rocking chairs in front of the door to the
  shoe department.\n\nThe walk goes past public art\, to Frog Level for a b
 rief stop at Panacea Coffee Company\, to Waynesville Middle School\, throu
 gh an interesting neighborhood\, and back to the start point.\n\nThere are
  some hills\, so some may want a walking pole\; sneakers should be fine. D
 ogs are welcome. Strollers should be ok. Bring plenty of water and a prote
 in snack. Dress appropriately for the weather. Consider a hat and sunscree
 n.\n\nParking is easier a block to either side of Main Street. Mast Genera
 l Store doesn't have a public restroom\, but we can direct you to one near
 by should you need it. There are one or two restrooms along the route.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/313816490/
