 d the American Singles Golf Association (ASGA) can attend up to three even
 ts and then decide whether or not to join. The total of three events also 
 includes the outings posted on the [Asheville ASGA website](www.asheville.
 singlesgolf.com) .\nPlease arrive early so we can tee off no later than 4:
