SUMMARY:Psychedelic Integration Circle
DESCRIPTION:Psychedelic Society of Asheville\nWe invite you to gather with
  us in a safe\, confidential\, and supportive space to share\, reflect\, a
 nd connect with community.\n\nIntegration is a practice of intentionally s
 lowing down\, listening inward\, and making meaning of our experiences so 
 they can truly support and enrich our lives. Through integration\, we can 
 cultivate greater awareness of our thoughts\, emotions\, and patterns\, al
 lowing us to move through life’s changes with greater resilience\, clari
 ty\, and compassion.\n\nWe are delighted to welcome Becca Marshall as our 
 Psychedelic Integration Circle facilitator. Becca is an Integrative Psycho
 therapist\, Aligned Living Coach\, Psychedelic Integration Guide\, and the
  founder of ActivXchange. Her work supports individuals navigating major l
 ife transitions\, whether entering adulthood\, stepping into leadership\, 
 or guiding others through healing and transformation\, with grounded prese
 nce and deep care.\n\nThis ongoing circle is open to all whether you are s
 imply curious\, actively preparing for or integrating psychedelic experien
 ces\, or have been walking this path for some time. Our intention is to fo
 ster connection\, shared wisdom\, and mutual support within our ever-growi
 ng psychedelic community here in Asheville. All are welcome.\n\nPlease not
 e that this is a sober gathering. To ensure the integrity and safety of ou
 r space\, we do not permit the sale\, purchase\, or sourcing of any illega
 l substances or activities at our events. Anyone not honoring these guidel
 ines will be respectfully asked to leave.\n\nThis gathering is offered wit
 h a suggested $10 donation. No one will be turned away for lack of funds. 
 Contributions help cover venue costs and support future offerings from the
  Psychedelic Society of Asheville.\n\nThank you for being part of this com
 munity and we look forward to gathering with you soon! ✨
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/psychedelic-society-of-asheville/even
 ts/314230848/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260411T152420Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260411T152420Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
