SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 17th\n\n1st Dance 
 Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wa
 ve 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ \\| Faci
 litator Ted Riskin\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that
  the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle a
 nd people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure
  a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your 
 price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registra
 tion Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUN
 TEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volun
 teer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashe
 villemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVT
 F6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFE
 SCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)
 \n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the open
 ing circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nColl
 ective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](h
 ttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTA
 AYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CS
 yB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2Jnrn
 WxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world
  that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves wit
 hin a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity an
 d healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for per
 sonal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organizat
 ion.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
