SUMMARY:Access Bars\, Facelift & Body Process Exchange
DESCRIPTION:Access Consciousness® Asheville\nBars! Facelift!! & Body Proc
 esses!!!\n\nHave you ever taken a Bars\, Facelift or Body Process class?\n
 Yes. Then this meet up is for you! Even if you need to borrow a chart or a
 sk questions because you don't remember where the points are\, you are wel
 come to come. Newbies are also welcome\, we just ask that you make a small
  monetary contribution since you will not be gifting Bars.\n\nWe'll be gat
 hering at my home in Marshall where we will be having a Potluck & Bars swa
 p. We'll be making a big pot of soup so please when you RSVP leave a note 
 as to what you'd like to bring. Ideas: salad\, bread\, spread\, salty snac
 k\, sweet snack\, or something else...\n\nRSVP here or on my website www.c
 onsciousbeing.institute\n\nI'll be hosting these more regularly as well as
  free and low cost clinics for the local community so please reach out if 
 you have any ideas for location or if you'd like to come run bars!
