SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ Rory Jagdeo
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 24th\n\n1st Dance 
 Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wa
 ve 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ \\| Faci
 litator Rory Jagdeo\nIntention: TBA\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note tha
 t the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle 
 and people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensur
 e a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your
  price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registr
 ation Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLU
 NTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volu
 nteer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExV
 TF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGF
 ESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA
 )\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the ope
 ning circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCol
 lective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](
 https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMT
 AAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5C
 SyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2Jnr
 nWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a worl
 d that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves wi
 thin a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity a
 nd healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for pe
 rsonal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organiza
 tion.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
