X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Mindful Meet Mingle Asheville Singles": "https://www.meetup.com/mindful-meet-mingle-asheville-singles/events/313895119/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_mindful_meet_mingle_asheville_singles
X-SOURCE:Mindful Meet & Mingle Asheville Singles
UID:event_313895119@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260418T030455Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260530T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260530T160000
SUMMARY:Mindful Meet & Mingle- Open to all Singles 
DESCRIPTION:Mindful Meet & Mingle – Asheville Singles\nMindful Meet & Mi
 ngle\nAn evening of connection\, conversation\, and conscious community.\n
 \n**This event is non secular and not affiliated with the event located in
  any way**.\n\nJoin us for a relaxed and welcoming gathering where mindful
  singles come together.\n\nThis isn’t speed dating or small talk\, it’
 s about slowing down\, being present\, and meeting like-hearted people in 
 a grounded\, authentic space. Whether you're new to the area\, exploring d
 ating with fresh eyes\, or simply looking to expand your social circle wit
 h conscious connections\, this event is for you.\n\nWe'll begin with casua
 l introductions\, followed by lightly facilitated conversation prompts to 
 spark deeper\, more meaningful exchanges. Come solo or bring a friend—ev
 eryone will have a chance to connect in a low-pressure\, friendly atmosphe
 re.\n\nWhat to expect:\n\\- Like\\-minded singles open to mindful connecti
 on\n\\- Guided conversation starters to go beyond surface\\-level chat\n\\
 - A chance to relax and be yourself\n\nWhether romance blooms or you walk 
 away with new friends and insights\, this is an evening to nourish your so
 cial and emotional well-being.\n\nOpen to singles of all genders and orien
 tations
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/mindful-meet-mingle-asheville-singles
 /events/313895119/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260322T140420Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260322T140420Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
