SUMMARY:Nine and Dine at Chestnut Mountain Golf Course
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Singles Over 50 Golf Meetup\nNine of holes of golf w
 ith dinner afterwards.\n**Organizer will notify attendees if weather will 
 cause delays or cancellation.**\nMembers of this Meetup who have not joine
 d the American Singles Golf Association (ASGA) can attend up to three even
 ts and then decide whether or not to join. The total of three events also 
 includes the outings posted on the [Asheville ASGA website](www.asheville.
 singlesgolf.com) .\nPlease arrive early so we can tee off no later than 4:
 30pm.\nOrganizer will notify attendees if there is a weather delay or canc
 ellation.
